---
---

<section class="bg-white py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="reveal mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 sm:text-4xl">
        Beyond Individual Productivity
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-neutral-500">
        AI coding assistants help one developer at a time. Ageneer transforms your entire team.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <!-- Card: AI Coding Assistants -->
      <div class="reveal rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-8">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-200 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-600">
          Traditional Approach
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-700">AI Coding Assistants</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-neutral-500">
          Claude Code, Codex, and Copilot make individual developers more productive. One developer, one tool, one task at a time.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-neutral-500">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="mt-1 text-neutral-400">&mdash;</span>
            Single developer productivity
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="mt-1 text-neutral-400">&mdash;</span>
            Requires human in the loop
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="mt-1 text-neutral-400">&mdash;</span>
            Code completion &amp; suggestions
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card: Ageneer (highlighted) -->
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border-2 border-brand-500/40 bg-white p-8 shadow-xl shadow-brand-500/5">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-50/50 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-brand-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-700">
            The Ageneer Way
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Ageneer</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-neutral-600">
            Makes your entire tech team productive. Integrates as a team member. Communicates, collaborates, and ships autonomously.
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-neutral-700">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              Full team productivity multiplier
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              Fully autonomous execution
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-brand-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              Communicates &amp; collaborates with team
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="reveal mt-12 text-center text-lg font-medium text-neutral-700">
      Stop thinking of AI as a developer tool.<br class="sm:hidden" />
      <span class="text-brand-700"> Start thinking of it as a team member.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
